  data: {
    LLM: "In Round 2, if your first card is a 2, always guess 'Higher'. If it's an Ace, always guess 'Lower'.\n\nRound 3 (Inside/Outside): If you have a 3 and a Jack, 'Inside' has 7 winning cards (4-10) while 'Outside' has 5 (2, Q, K, A, and 3/J pushes). Go with the higher probability.\n\nCard Counting: If you are playing with many people and half the Aces have already been revealed, adjust your Round 2 and Round 4 guesses accordingly.",
